#: ../../docs/module/module-intro.rst:5 0f382aade4144f7d89f983a7bf9a5dad
msgid "module简介"
msgstr "Module Introduction"

#: ../../docs/module/module-intro.rst:7 8590300d9a88410b97dee0afced70411
msgid ""
"由于不同用户在系统上可能需要使用不同的软件环境，配置不同的环境变量， "
"默认配置无法满足所有用户的需要，因而在系统上安装了module软件来进行对环境变量的管理， 方便用户更好地使用机器。"
msgstr ""
"Different users may need different software environments and environment "
"variables. The default configuration cannot cover every case, so the "
"module system is installed on cnSRC to manage environment variables and "
"make the machines easier to use."

#: ../../docs/module/module-intro.rst:11 fcce497473b14da4bee195022c04c2bf
msgid "Envrionment modules工具用来快速的设置和修改用户编译运行环境。"
msgstr ""
"The Environment Modules tool is used to quickly set and modify user "
"compilation and runtime environments."

#: ../../docs/module/module-intro.rst:13 7a3222e6bfb84eb18d1399f4dbaf47c6
msgid "Envrionment modules通过加载和卸载modulefile文件可直接改变用户的环境变量，用户不需要修改.bashrc，从而避免误操作。"
msgstr ""
"Environment Modules can directly change user environment variables by "
"loading and unloading module files, eliminating the need for users to "
"modify .bashrc and avoiding accidental operations."

#: ../../docs/module/module-intro.rst:16 6fa7ee3fdd1b4d5fa01bda9e0e4d493d
msgid ""
"`module`通过配置*modulefile*支持环境变量的动态修改， 能够控制软件不同版本对环境变量的依赖关系。 "
"用户通过简单的命令即可获得适于自己环境变量设置，因而提高了用户移植软件的效率。"
msgstr ""
"module dynamically modifies environment variables by configuring module "
"files and can control the dependency relationships of different software "
"versions on environment variables.Users can easily obtain environment "
"variable settings suitable for their own needs with simple commands, "
"thereby improving the efficiency of software portability for users."

